OL,3,GNEWSASubway franchise director banned
OL,4,Afor #30k Covid claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Subway franchise director has
OL,7,Fbeen banned after exploiting the Eat
OL,8,FOut to Help Out scheme during the
OL,9,Fcoronavirus pandemic, according to the
OL,10,FInsolvency Service.
OL,12,FMd Arfen, who was the director of L & Z
OL,13,FFoods Ltd which traded as a Subway on
OL,14,FGuildford High Street, submitted five
OL,15,FEat Out to Help Out claims worth more
OL,16,Fthan #30,000 in August 2020, the
OL,17,Fservice said.
OL,19,FHe has been banned as a company
OL,20,Fdirector for 11 years following an
OL,21,Finvestigation by the government agency.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,328,320,200,140,0,100
