OL,3,GNEWSASubway franchise director banned
OL,4,Afor #30k Covid claim
OL,5,
OL,6,FChief investigator Victoria Edgar said
OL,7,FArfen "claimed more than #30,000 of
OL,8,Ftaxpayers' money that his company was
OL,9,Fnot entitled to while businesses across
OL,10,Fthe country were fighting to survive".
